WEBVTT

00:11:29.053 --> 00:11:31.918
ada benda yang disebut sebagai
"resepetor nikotinis".

00:11:32.929 --> 00:11:34.404
Mereka di sana ...

00:11:34.428 --> 00:11:35.592
menunggu.

00:11:35.945 --> 00:11:39.207
Mereka menunggu, menurut dokumen
Philip Morris,

00:11:39.231 --> 00:11:41.297
"unit dosis nikotin" berikutnya.

00:11:43.252 --> 00:11:45.918
Perokok yang kalian lihat di luar,

00:11:45.942 --> 00:11:47.831
berkerumun dengan perokok lainnya,

00:11:47.855 --> 00:11:49.339
di udara dingin,

00:11:49.363 --> 00:11:50.625
di udara berangin,

00:11:50.649 --> 00:11:52.342
di hujan,

00:11:52.366 --> 00:11:54.620
sedang mengalami candu

00:11:54.644 --> 00:11:57.342
dan mungkin mengalami simtom
sakau.

00:11:58.564 --> 00:12:02.125
Simtom sakau merupakan pesan kimiawi